    "example": "<section data-ds=\"natural-pillars\" class=\"section natural-pillars\" aria-labelledby=\"np-title\"><div class=\"section__inner\"><div class=\"natural-pillars__grid\"><div class=\"natural-pillars__content\"><div class=\"natural-pillars__head\"><h2 class=\"natural-pillars__title\" id=\"np-title\">Taste you can trust</h2><p class=\"natural-pillars__subtitle\">Better for people, better for the planet</p></div><ol class=\"natural-pillars__list\"><li data-ds=\"pillar-item\" class=\"pillar-item\"><span class=\"pillar-item__number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><p class=\"pillar-item__title\">Better noodles start with better production</p><p class=\"pillar-item__text\">CO2-neutral production commitments and factory-level sourcing standards.</p></li><li data-ds=\"pillar-item\" class=\"pillar-item\"><span class=\"pillar-item__number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><p class=\"pillar-item__title\">Growing together with local communities</p><p class=\"pillar-item__text\">Sourcing partnerships and support programmes with local farming communities.</p></li><li data-ds=\"pillar-item\" class=\"pillar-item\"><span class=\"pillar-item__number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><p class=\"pillar-item__title\">Innovation in every recipe</p><p class=\"pillar-item__text\">R&amp;D behind each natural substitution, tested to keep the exact same taste.</p></li><li data-ds=\"pillar-item\" class=\"pillar-item\"><span class=\"pillar-item__number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><p class=\"pillar-item__title\">Cleaner recipe. Same great taste.</p><p class=\"pillar-item__text\">Closing statement tying the four pillars back to the «Taste you can trust» claim.</p></li></ol></div><figure class=\"natural-pillars__media\"><img class=\"natural-pillars__image\" src=\"../assets/images/placeholder.svg\" alt=\"\"></figure></div></div></section>",
